Title: Colchester running event to honour life of beloved runner
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'Lydia Cunningham', 'Text': '"Arthur was incredibly loved by the community,"', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 41}}, {'Speaker': 'Lydia Cunningham', 'Text': 'He was a "very kind man who was very highly thought of and popular",', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 66}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'A memorial running race is set to take place to honour the life of a beloved athlete who died in a road crash.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 93}}, {'Description': "Colchester Harriers AC - Mr Whiston's running club - has organised the first anniversary event which is due to start as the garrison athletics track, external in the city at 09:30 BST on Sunday.", 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 167}}, {'Description': 'The money raised from the event is set to be donated to the Essex Wildlife Trust, a charity which Mr Whiston supported.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 107}}, {'Description': 'Runners can still turn up on the day of the event and register to take part.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 6, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 70}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'A joyful looking older man in a green running vest standing outside with cars parked behind him. He has a blue ribbon round his neck, is wearing glasses and has greying hair.'}]}
